        "quote": "(b) Of the members appointed to the Advisory Board, three shall be appointed for a term of two years and two shall be appointed for a term of one year, after which all terms shall be for a two-year period. Members shall not serve beyond the end of their appointed terms. Upon expiration of a term, the position shall remain vacant until a successor is appointed. Any vacancy shall be filled by appointment of the Mayor with the consent of the City Council for the unexpired term.",
